The ReSTIR story's rounds of spatial reuse
==========================================

What the story draws on the canvas (lab/src/math/) for chapter 4's beats `c4-rounds-tree` and `c4-rounds-reach`,
stage by stage as its stage (`stepOf "rounds" 4`, the clips below) goes from 0 to 4: the paper's tree of reservoirs, P's round-2 reservoir combining
k neighbours' round-1 reservoirs, each combining k pixels' own (k and the radius are the dock's `restirNeighbours`
and `restirRadius`); its count, k to the n times M; then, on a logarithmic scale, that count against the distinct
pixels the rounds reach with the lab's neighbour pattern (examples.rs `reach`), and the paper's rounds marked.

$[Import* std]
$[Import* render_lab_runtime]
$[Import* render_lab_math]
$[Import* paper_restir_values]
$[Import* paper_restir_natives]
$[Import* paper_restir_common]

The example

The candidates each pixel draws (the paper's thirty-two), the rounds the plot runs to, and the seed of the
neighbours' rotations.
$[# _count 32]
$[# _rounds 9]
$[# _seed 5]
The size of the scene's formulas, and where the counts go.
$[# _size 0.44]
$[# _labelX 4.8]

The tree

Fn([Int], Graph). The paper's tree for two rounds: P, its k neighbours, and theirs, as dots.
$[# {_tree k}
    [# n {+ 1 {+ k {* k k}}}]
    [# nodes {map
        {range 0 n}
        {^ {i} {dotAt f"{node${str i}}" origin
            {!if {= i 0} 0.17 {!if {<= i k} 0.12 0.08}}
            {!if {= i 0} accentColor {!if {<= i k} estimateColor targetColor}}}}}]
    [# edges {append
        {map {range 1 {+ k 1}} {^ {i} {pair 0 i}}}
        {flatten {map
            {range 1 {+ k 1}}
            {^ {i} {map {range 0 k} {^ {j} {pair i {+ {+ k 1} {+ {* {- i 1} k} j}}}}}}}}}]
    {graph "tree" nodes edges "tree" {box {v2 -6.6 -2.2} {v2 2.3 2.6}} false textDimColor 0}]

Fn([Int], List(ScorePart)). The tree (stages 1 and 2): the pixels' own reservoirs, round 1 combining k of them
into each neighbour's, round 2 combining those into P's, each level's count beside it; then the count for n rounds,
and every leaf lit (each a new neighbour). It is whole at the end of stage 2 (where the first beat ends) and fades
out at once after it.
$[# {_treeParts k}
    [# g {_tree k}]
    [# at {.at g}]
    [# m _count]
    [# leaves {flatten {map {range {+ k 1} {+ 1 {+ k {* k k}}}} {^ {i} {nth {.nodes g} i}}}}]
    [# middle {flatten {map {range 1 {+ k 1}} {^ {i} {nth {.nodes g} i}}}}]
    [# root {nth {.nodes g} 0}]
    [# lowEdges {flatten {map {range k {* k {+ k 1}}} {^ {e} {nth {.edges g} e}}}}]
    [# highEdges {flatten {map {range 0 k} {^ {e} {nth {.edges g} e}}}}]
    [# yLeaf {.y {nth at {+ k 1}}}]
    [# yMid {.y {nth at 1}}]
    [# yRoot {.y {nth at 0}}]
    [# {_level id caption latex y color} {append
        {moveTo caption {v2 _labelX {+ y 0.45}}}
        {moveTo {tex id latex _size color} {v2 _labelX y}}}]
    [# leafCount {_level "leafM"
        {caption "leafMNote" {textKey "roundsmath-own"} 0.32 textDimColor}
        f"{M = ${str m}}"
        yLeaf
        targetColor}]
    [# midCount {_level "midM"
        {caption "midMNote" {textKey "roundsmath-round1"} 0.32 textDimColor}
        f"{k\,M = ${str {* k m}}}"
        yMid
        estimateColor}]
    [# rootAt {v2 _labelX yRoot}]
    [# rootLabel {moveTo
        {texParts "rootM" f"{k^{\lit{1}{2}} M = ${str {* {* k k} m}}}" _size accentColor
            {' "n"}
            {' accentColor}}
        rootAt}]
    [# rootGeneral {moveTo
        {texParts "rootM" f"{k^{\lit{1}{n}} M}" 0.56 accentColor {' "n"} {' accentColor}}
        rootAt}]
    [# rootNote {moveTo
        {caption "rootNote" {textKey "roundsmath-round2"} 0.32 textDimColor}
        {v2 _labelX {+ yRoot 0.45}}}]
    [# newNote {moveTo
        {caption "newNote" {textKey "roundsmath-paths"} 0.32 targetColor}
        {v2 -1.7 -2.75}}]
    [# {_still fig} {^ {s} fig}]
    [# {_in id fig at length how} {part id
        {_still fig}
        {' {enterOver at length how} {exitOver 2.0 0.1 fadeOut}}}]
    {'
        {part "leaves"
            {_still leaves}
            {'
                {enterOver 0.0 0.2 fadeIn}
                {emphasize 1.3 2.0 {^ {t f} {indicateEach t f accentColor}}}
                {exitOver 2.0 0.1 fadeOut}}}
        {_in "leafM" leafCount 0.0 0.2 fadeIn}
        {_in "lowEdges" lowEdges 0.15 0.3 create}
        {_in "middle" middle 0.3 0.15 fadeIn}
        {_in "midM" midCount 0.45 0.15 fadeIn}
        {_in "highEdges" highEdges 0.55 0.25 create}
        {_in "root" root 0.7 0.15 fadeIn}
        {_in "rootNote" rootNote 0.75 0.15 fadeIn}
        {part "rootM"
            {_still rootLabel}
            {'
                {enterOver 0.85 0.15 fadeIn}
                {becomeOver 1.0 0.4 {_still rootGeneral}}
                {exitOver 2.0 0.1 fadeOut}}}
        {_in "newNote" newNote 1.5 0.25 fadeIn}}]

The reach

Fn([Int, Float], List(ScorePart)). The count against the pixels reached (stages 3 and 4), on a logarithmic scale:
k to the n times M for each number of rounds, the distinct pixels the rounds end on times M below it, and the
paper's rounds marked.
$[# {_reachParts k radius}
    [# reach {exampleReach k radius _rounds _seed}]
    [# m {float _count}]
    [# ax {axesIn
        {box {v2 -5.4 -2.3} {v2 2.2 2.6}}
        {axisRange 0.0 {float _rounds} 1.0}
        {axisRange 1.0 8.0 1.0}}]
    [# {_log x} {/ {ln x} {ln 10.0}}]
    [# paths {map reach {^ {r} {onAxes ax {float {.n r}} {_log {* {.paths r} m}}}}}]
    [# pixels {map reach {^ {r} {onAxes ax {float {.n r}} {_log {* {float {.pixels r}} m}}}}}]
    [# yLabels {flatten {map
        {range 1 9}
        {^ {i} {moveTo
            {tex f"{yl${str i}}" f"{10^{${str i}}}" 0.42 textDimColor}
            {add2 {onAxes ax 0.0 {float i}} {v2 -0.6 0.0}}}}}}]
    [# axes {flatten {'
        {axesFigure "axes" ax textDimColor 0.34 true false}
        yLabels
        {moveTo
            {caption "axisN" {textKey "roundsmath-rounds"} 0.32 textDimColor}
            {add2 {onAxes ax {/ {float _rounds} 2.0} 1.0} {v2 0.0 -0.85}}}}}]
    [# {_series id points color} {append
        {pathThrough id points color 3.0}
        {flatten {map
            {zip {range 0 {length points}} points}
            {^ {e} {dotAt {++ id {str {.first e}}} {.second e} 0.07 color}}}}}]
    [# {_end caption points dy} {moveTo caption {add2
        {nth points {- {length points} 1}}
        {v2 2.5 dy}}}]
    [# {_mark id caption n dx} {append
        {dashedLine {++ id "Line"} {onAxes ax n 1.0} {onAxes ax n 8.0} accentColor 2.0}
        {moveTo caption {add2 {onAxes ax n 8.0} {v2 dx 0.65}}}}]
    [# {_in id fig at length how} {part id {^ {s} fig} {' {enterOver at length how}}}]
    {'
        {_in "axes" axes 2.1 0.2 fadeIn}
        {_in "paths" {_series "paths" paths targetColor} 2.25 0.3 create}
        {_in "pathsNote"
            {_end {caption "pathsNote" {textKey "roundsmath-paths"} 0.32 targetColor} paths 0.0}
            2.3
            0.2
            fadeIn}
        {_in "pixels" {_series "pixels" pixels totalColor} 2.5 0.35 create}
        {_in "pixelsNote"
            {_end {caption "pixelsNote" {textKey "roundsmath-pixels"} 0.32 totalColor} pixels 0.0}
            2.75
            0.2
            fadeIn}
        {_in "biased"
            {_mark "biased"
                {caption "biased" {textKey "roundsmath-biased"} 0.32 accentColor}
                2.0
                1.0}
            3.0
            0.3
            fadeIn}
        {_in "unbiased"
            {_mark "unbiased"
                {caption "unbiased" {textKey "roundsmath-unbiased"} 0.32 accentColor}
                1.0
                -0.7}
            3.5
            0.3
            fadeIn}}]

The scene

Fn([Int, Float], Score). The rounds of spatial reuse as a score of 4 steps: the paper's tree, then the count
against the pixels the rounds reach.
$[# {_score k radius} {score "rounds" 4 {append {_treeParts k} {_reachParts k radius}} {'}}]

The hook

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The rounds of spatial reuse at stage its stage (`stepOf "rounds" 4`, the clips below).
$[# roundsMath {: {^ {t} {playScore {_score {restirNeighbours} {float {restirRadius}}}}} Math}]

Clips

The scene's steps as clips (lab/src/clip.rs): its demonstration's Play plays every step in order, a second each;
the story plays each over its sentence's words, and sets the scene back to a step where a beat starts.
$[# roundsSteps [% {stepsInOrder "rounds" 4}]]
$[# roundsAt0 [% {stepsAt "rounds" 4 0}]]
The second beat opens a tenth of a step into stage 3, the tree gone and the reach about to be drawn (the first beat
ends on the whole tree, at 2); its first step's clip starts there too.
$[# roundsAt2 [% {clip {' {progressKeys "rounds" {' {keyframe 0.0 2.1 "linear"}}}}}]]
$[# roundsStep1 [% {stepClip "rounds" 1 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# roundsStep2 [% {stepClip "rounds" 2 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# roundsStep3 [% {stepClip "rounds" 3 0.1 1.0}]]
$[# roundsStep4From0To50 [% {stepClip "rounds" 4 0.0 0.5}]]
$[# roundsStep4From50To100 [% {stepClip "rounds" 4 0.5 1.0}]]
